SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 CEST: Schloss Wiepersdorf Individual and Collaborati
 ve Fellowships 2028 (Brandenburg\; EUR 1\,200/month plus room and board)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 15 Apr 2027 at 23:59 CEST.\n\nThree-month residential fe
 llowships at Schloss Wiepersdorf for artists\, writers\, composers and sch
 olars from Germany and abroad. Fellows get room\, board\, a EUR 1\,200 mon
 thly stipend and a material grant\; fine artists get a studio where space 
 allows. Collaborative fellowships host one or two named partners from any 
 artistic field.\n\nOrganisation: Schloss Wiepersdorf (state of Brandenburg
 )\nLocation: Wiepersdorf\, Brandenburg\, Germany. In person\; fellows spen
 d most of the period on site.\nAward: EUR 1\,200 per month stipend\, a one
 -time EUR 480 material grant\, room and board\, and German visa costs wher
 e needed. No application fee.\nDuration: 3 months: March to May\, June to 
 August\, or September to November 2028\n\nMore: https://www.schloss-wieper
 sdorf.de/en/individual-and-collaborative-fellowships.html?utm_source=artif
 icialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.schloss-wiepersdorf.de/en/individual-and-collaborative-fell
 owships.html?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Wiepersdorf\, Brandenburg\, Germany. In person\; fellows spend mos
 t of the period on site.
END:VEVENT
