DESCRIPTION:The federal fund for independent performing arts supports new p
 roductions by professional artists and ensembles based in Germany\, with g
 rants of EUR 15\,000 to 50\,000 per production.\n\nOrganisation: Fonds Dar
 stellende Kuenste\nLocation: Germany. Artists and groups based and mainly 
 working in Germany.\nAward: EUR 15\,000 to 50\,000 per production. At leas
 t 50 percent of the requested amount must already be approved from German 
 municipal and/or state public funds. No application fee.\nDuration: Projec
 t period 15 April 2027 to 30 June 2028\n\nMore: https://www.fonds-daku.de/
 foerderung/foerderprogramme/produktionsfoerderung-1/produktionsfoerderung/
