  for artists and cultural professionals: individual or group (up to 5 peop
 le) mobility to carry out an artistic or cultural project in another Creat
 ive Europe country\, with the support of an international partner of your 
 own choosing (an individual or an organisation). The project must follow 2
  of the 4 objectives: to learn\, to create\, to explore\, or to connect.\n
 \nOrganisation: Creative Europe (Culture Moves Europe)\, implemented by th
 e Goethe-Institut\nLocation: Creative Europe countries (incl. overseas cou
 ntries and territories and outermost regions)\; the project takes place in
  another Creative Europe country than your residence\nAward: EUR 85 per da
 y of project implementation\, plus travel allowance of EUR 400 (under 5\,0
 00 km) or EUR 800 (from 5\,000 km). Top-ups where applicable: green mobili
 ty EUR 400\, overseas countries and territories / outermost regions EUR 17
 5\, family EUR 200 per child under 18\, visa EUR 120. Accessibility suppor
 t: EUR 30 per day plus actual cost or fixed allowance for personal assista
 nce or sign language interpretation. No application fee.\nDuration: Projec
 t-based\n\nMore: https://culture.ec.europa.eu/culture-moves-europe/call-fo
 r-individual-mobility?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=ref
 erral
