 for Culture and Social Cohesion\nLocation: Berlin\, Germany. For professio
 nal groups (privately organised) and individual artists in dance\, perform
 ing and performative arts without their own venue\, with their main workin
 g base in Berlin.\nAward: Four-year funding (2028 to 2031) covering produc
 tion-related personnel and material costs\, performance costs and general 
