 ees should follow the Berlin minimum-fee recommendations. No application f
 ee.\nDuration: Four calendar years\, 2028 to 2031. The programme is advert
 ised every fourth year in December for the four years after next\; funding
  starts January 2028.\n\nMore: https://www.berlin.de/sen/kultur/foerderung
